# The public origin the app is served from, used to build ABSOLUTE social-card
# URLs in index.html (`%VITE_SITE_URL%`). Crawlers — Facebook and LinkedIn
# especially — do not reliably resolve a relative og:image, so this has to be set
# before the app is promoted anywhere.
#
# Left empty on purpose in the repository: a wrong hardcoded domain is worse than
# a relative path, because it points at somebody else's server. Set it to the
# real origin at deploy time, with no trailing slash:
#
#   VITE_SITE_URL=https://seepat.ph
#
# With it empty the tags fall back to root-relative paths, which Twitter, Slack
# and WhatsApp resolve correctly.
VITE_SITE_URL=
